    "texto_html": "<div class=\"ExternalClassB5F1C9AB695D4B2B885119899FF0C3EE\">\n\n\n<span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">\n</span><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">\n</span><title style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">Resolução Nº 5.342</title><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">\n</span><style style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">\r\n</style><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">\n\n\n\n\n\n</span><div class=\"WordSection1\"><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom&#58;18pt;text-align&#58;center;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">RESOLUÇÃO\nCMN Nº 5.342, DE 14 DE SETEMBRO DE 2026</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin&#58;0cm 0cm 18pt 9cm;text-align&#58;justify;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">Altera o anexo à Resolução CMN nº 4.995, de 24\nde março de 2022.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-bottom&#58;18pt;text-align&#58;justify;text-indent&#58;70.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">O\nBanco Central do Brasil, na forma do art. 9º da Lei nº 4.595, de 31 de dezembro\nde 1964, torna público que o Conselho Monetário Nacional, em sessão extraordinária\nrealizada em 14 de setembro de 2026, tendo em vista as disposições dos arts.\n3º, <i>caput</i>, incisos IV, VI e VII, e 4º, <i>caput</i>, incisos VI, VIII e\nX, da mencionada Lei,</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-bottom&#58;18pt;text-align&#58;justify;text-indent&#58;70.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">R\nE S O L V E U &#58;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-bottom&#58;6pt;text-align&#58;justify;text-indent&#58;70.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">Art. 1º&#160;\nO anexo à Resolução CMN nº 4.995, de 24 de março de 2022, publicada no Diário Oficial\nda União de 28 de março de 2022, passa a vigorar com as alterações constantes no\nanexo a esta Resolução.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-bottom&#58;12pt;text-align&#58;justify;text-indent&#58;70.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">Art.\n2º&#160; Esta Resolução entra em vigor na data de sua publicação.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align&#58;center;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">GABRIEL MURICCA GALÍPOLO<br></span><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;\">Presidente do Banco Central do Brasil</span></p><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;\">\n\n</span><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;\"><br clear=\"all\" style=\"\">\n</span><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom&#58;12pt;text-align&#58;center;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">ANEXO</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom&#58;12pt;text-align&#58;center;\"><span style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">(Anexo à Resolução CMN nº 4.995, de 24\nde março de 2022)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom&#58;6pt;text-align&#58;center;\"><b style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">Limite anual para contratação de operações\nde crédito para os órgãos e entidades do setor público a ser observado pelas instituições\nfinanceiras e demais instituições autorizadas a funcionar pelo Banco Central do\nBrasil.</b></p>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\"></span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><span style=\"color&#58;#444444;\">\n  </span><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"671\" style=\"width&#58;503pt;border-collapse&#58;collapse;border-width&#58;medium;border-style&#58;none;border-color&#58;currentcolor;\">\n <tbody><tr style=\"height&#58;25.65pt;\"><td width=\"47\" style=\"width&#58;35.15pt;border&#58;1pt solid windowtext;padding&#58;0cm 5.4pt;height&#58;25.65pt;\">\n  <p class=\"MsoPlainText\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align&#58;center;\"><strong style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">Ano</strong></p>\n  </td>\n  <td width=\"208\" style=\"width&#58;156.1pt;border-width&#58;1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style&#58;solid solid solid none;border-color&#58;windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding&#58;0cm 5.4pt;height&#58;25.65pt;\">\n  <p class=\"MsoPlainText\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align&#58;center;\"><strong style=\"font-family&#58;calibri;font-size&#58;17.3333px;color&#58;#444444;\">Operações com garantia\n  da União</strong></p>\n  </td>\n  <